{
  "info": {
    "name": "MedOS Voice AI — Department & Doctor APIs",
    "description": "Voice-AI / chatbot integration APIs for MedOS. Field names here match the DEPLOYED API exactly — do not rename params.\n\n**Quick start**\n1. Set collection variables `baseUrl`, `email`, `password`.\n2. Run **Auth › Login** once — it auto-saves the Bearer token.\n3. Discovery: **Get Departments** → **Get Doctors in Department** (auto-saves `doctorId`).\n4. New patient booking (the reliable flow): **Register Patient** (auto-saves `patientId`) → **Book Appointment** (books with that `patientId`).\n\nAll data endpoints are Sanctum-authenticated, throttled 30 req/min, and the hospital is auto-resolved from the token. Book/reschedule/cancel resolve the patient by `patient_id` (preferred) or `phone` (last-10-digit match) — always prefer the `patient_id` returned by Register Patient.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "https://medos.haztech.cloud", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "email", "value": "admin@haztech.in", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "password123", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "hospitalId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "department", "value": "Cardiology", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "doctorId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "patientId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "patientPhone", "value": "9876543210", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "patientName", "value": "Test Caller", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "appointmentId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (get token)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('login ok', () => pm.expect(res.success).to.be.true);",
                  "if (res && res.data && res.data.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.data.token);",
                  "  console.log('Saved token');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"] },
            "description": "Authenticate → returns `data.token`. Test script auto-saves it. For production, prefer a long-lived key from Admin › Settings › API Keys."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Departments & Doctors",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Departments",
          "event": [
            { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "const res = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('success', () => pm.expect(res.success).to.be.true);",
              "const d = res.data && res.data.departments;",
              "if (d && d.length) pm.collectionVariables.set('department', d[0].department);"
            ] } }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [ { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/departments", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "departments"] },
            "description": "List every department with its doctor_count and nested doctors."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Doctors in Department",
          "event": [
            { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "const res = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('success', () => pm.expect(res.success).to.be.true);",
              "const docs = res.data && res.data.doctors;",
              "if (docs && docs.length) {",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('doctorId', docs[0].doctor_id);",
              "  console.log('doctorId =', docs[0].doctor_id, docs[0].name);",
              "}"
            ] } }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [ { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctors?department={{department}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "doctors"],
              "query": [ { "key": "department", "value": "{{department}}", "description": "Department name (case-insensitive). Omit to list all doctors." } ]
            },
            "description": "Doctors in a department, each with next_available slot. Auto-saves the first doctor's id into {{doctorId}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Doctor Schedule (fuzzy name)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [ { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/doctor-schedule?name=priya&days=7",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "doctor-schedule"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "name", "value": "priya", "description": "Doctor name, partial/full (fuzzy, handles typos + 'Dr.' prefix). REQUIRED." },
                { "key": "days", "value": "7", "description": "Days of slots to return (1-30, default 7). NOTE: param is 'days', not 'date'." }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Find a doctor by name and return doctor_id + N-day available_slots."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Patient",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Customer Lookup by Phone",
          "event": [
            { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "const res = pm.response.json();",
              "if (res.success && res.data && res.data.patient_id) {",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('patientId', res.data.patient_id);",
              "}"
            ] } }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [ { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customer?phone={{patientPhone}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "customer"],
              "query": [ { "key": "phone", "value": "{{patientPhone}}", "description": "Matched by last 10 digits. REQUIRED." } ]
            },
            "description": "Look up an existing patient by phone. 404 if not found (then use Register Patient). Saves patient_id when found."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register Patient",
          "event": [
            { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "const res = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('success', () => pm.expect(res.success).to.be.true);",
              "if (res.data && res.data.patient_id) {",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('patientId', res.data.patient_id);",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('patientPhone', res.data.phone);",
              "  console.log('patientId =', res.data.patient_id, '| already_registered =', res.data.already_registered);",
              "}"
            ] } }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{patientName}}\",\n  \"phone\": \"{{patientPhone}}\",\n  \"gender\": \"unknown\",\n  \"age\": 30\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/register-patient", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "register-patient"] },
            "description": "Register a new patient. Only name + phone required (gender/age optional). Idempotent — an existing phone returns that patient with already_registered:true. Auto-saves patient_id into {{patientId}} — Book Appointment uses it next."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "My Appointments",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [ { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" } ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/my-appointments?phone={{patientPhone}}&include_past=false",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "my-appointments"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "phone", "value": "{{patientPhone}}", "description": "phone OR patient_id" },
                { "key": "include_past", "value": "false" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "List a patient's appointments (appointment_id, doctor, date, time, status)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Appointments",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Book Appointment",
          "event": [
            { "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "const res = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('booked', () => pm.expect(res.success).to.be.true);",
              "if (res.data && res.data.appointment_id) {",
              "  pm.collectionVariables.set('appointmentId', res.data.appointment_id);",
              "  console.log('appointment_id =', res.data.appointment_id, '| token =', res.data.token);",
              "}"
            ] } }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"doctor_id\": \"{{doctorId}}\",\n  \"patient_id\": \"{{patientId}}\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-07-23\",\n  \"time\": \"09:00\",\n  \"notes\": \"\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/book-appointment", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "book-appointment"] },
            "description": "Book an appointment. EXACT params: doctor_id (required uuid), patient_id (uuid) OR phone (string), date (YYYY-MM-DD), time (HH:mm), notes (optional).\n\nReliable flow: run Register Patient first so {{patientId}} is set, then this books with that id — no phone ambiguity. To book by phone instead, replace \"patient_id\": \"{{patientId}}\" with \"phone\": \"{{patientPhone}}\".\n\nValidates: doctor exists & active · patient exists · slot in future · doctor working then · slot free. Returns appointment_id, token (e.g. CAR-002), doctor, patient, date, time, status."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reschedule Appointment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"appointment_id\": \"{{appointmentId}}\",\n  \"date\": \"2026-07-24\",\n  \"time\": \"10:00\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reschedule-appointment", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "reschedule-appointment"] },
            "description": "Move an appointment. Params: appointment_id (required), date, time. Same slot validations as booking."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancel Appointment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"appointment_id\": \"{{appointmentId}}\",\n  \"reason\": \"Patient request\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cancel-appointment", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "cancel-appointment"] },
            "description": "Cancel an appointment. Params: appointment_id (required), reason (optional)."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
